name=Viewpoint - Steady Outlines Fix (ZB)
id=ViewpointOutlineFix
description=Stops character outlines from flickering under Viewpoint's 3D camera (e.g. Safe User Login's player outline, Viewpoint x A-LIFE's NPC outline). Viewpoint clears every outline right after each 3D capture unless it was set during the game's UI pass; outlines that mods set from world text, ticks or after the UI were therefore shown only on frames where the mod happened to run in between. With this mod an outline stays while it was set within the last 0.2 s; turning it off still hides it at once. Isometric is unchanged. No Viewpoint files are changed; turns itself off if Viewpoint changes that code. <LINE>Requires ZombieBuddy and Viewpoint.
modversion=1.0.1
versionMin=42.22
require=\ZombieBuddy,\Viewpoint
loadModAfter=\ZombieBuddy,\Viewpoint
ZBVersionMin=2.3.0
javaJarFile=media/java/client/ViewpointOutlineFix.jar
javaPkgName=viewpointoutlinefix
